8:["$","p","p-0",{"children":["为了使用域名，更加方便的进行配置，这里将虚拟机的 DHCP 改成了静态分配 IP，所以需要手动设置一下每台机器 IP 地址，这里以 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"192.168.50.131"}]," 为例。"]}]
9:["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"找到网络接口名称，运行以下命令："}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"SH","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-sh","children":"ip addr\n"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["查找以 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ens"}]," 或 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"eth"}]," 开头的接口名称。例如，",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ens33"}]," 或 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"eth0"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-1",{"data-language":"SH","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-sh","children":["hedon@ubuntu:~$ ip addr\n1: lo: <LOOPBACK,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 65536 qdisc noqueue state UNKNOWN group default qlen 1000\n    ",["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-built_in","children":"link"}],"/loopback 00:00:00:00:00:00 brd 00:00:00:00:00:00\n    inet 127.0.0.1/8 scope host lo\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n    inet6 ::1/128 scope host\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n2: ens33: <BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 1500 qdisc fq_codel state UP group default qlen 1000\n    ",["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-built_in","children":"link"}],"/ether 00:0c:29:82:9e:69 brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff\n    inet 192.168.50.133/24 brd 192.168.50.255 scope global dynamic noprefixroute ens33\n       valid_lft 1644sec preferred_lft 1644sec\n    inet6 fe80::c367:c7cc:3ad4:23b3/64 scope ",["$","span","span-2",{"className":"hljs-built_in","children":"link"}],"\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n"]}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["可以找到 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ens33"}],"，其中 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"inet 192.168.50.133/24"}]," 表示 IP 地址为 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"192.168.50.133"}],"，子网掩码为 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"/24"}],"（等于 ",["$","code","code-4",{"className":"$undefined","children":"255.255.255.0"}],"）。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":["这个 IP 地址是 DHCP 动态分配的，说明宿主机分配给虚拟机的 IP 范围就在 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"192.168.50.xxx"}],"，所以我们会将静态 IP 配置在这个范围内。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"获取网关地址"}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"SH","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-sh","children":"ip route | grep default\n"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"输出："}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-1",{"data-language":"SH","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-sh","children":"hedon@ubuntu:~$ ip route | grep default\ndefault via 192.168.50.2 dev ens33 proto dhcp metric 100\n"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["说明默认网关是 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"192.168.50.2"}],"，"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["编辑 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"/etc/network/interfaces"}]," 文件，配置静态 IP 地址，内容如下："]}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"TEX","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-tex","children":"auto ens33\niface ens33 inet static\n\taddress 192.168.50.131\n\tnetmask 255.255.255.0\n\tgateway 192.168.50.2\n\tdns-nameservers 8.8.8.8 8.8.4.4\n"}]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"重启"}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"SH","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-sh","children":"su reboot\n"}]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"再次查看 ip 地址"}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"SH","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-sh","children":"ip addr\n"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"有以下输出便说明静态 IP 配置成功了。"}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-1",{"data-language":"SH","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-sh","children":["1: lo: <LOOPBACK,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 65536 qdisc noqueue state UNKNOWN group default qlen 1000\n    ",["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-built_in","children":"link"}],"/loopback 00:00:00:00:00:00 brd 00:00:00:00:00:00\n    inet 127.0.0.1/8 scope host lo\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n    inet6 ::1/128 scope host\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n2: ens33: <BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 1500 qdisc fq_codel state UP group default qlen 1000\n    ","$L2e","/ether 00:0c:29:82:9e:69 brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff\n    inet 192.168.50.131/24 brd 192.168.50.255 scope global ens33\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n    inet6 fe80::20c:29ff:fe82:9e69/64 scope ","$L2f","\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n"]}]}],"\n"]}],"\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n"]}]
a:["$","details","details-0",{"open":true,"children":["\n",["$","summary","summary-0",{"children":"补充说明：`/etc/network/interfaces` 文件的配置"}],"\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["这是一个用于配置 Linux 系统上网络接口的文件。在这个示例中，我们为名为 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ens33"}]," 的网络接口配置了静态 IP 地址和相关的网络设置。下面是各行的解释："]}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"auto ens33"}],": 这一行表示在系统启动时自动激活 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ens33"}]," 网络接口。",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"auto"}]," 关键字后面跟着接口名称。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"iface ens33 inet static"}],": 这一行定义了 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ens33"}]," 网络接口的配置。",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"iface"}]," 关键字后面跟着接口名称，",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"inet"}]," 表示我们正在配置 IPv4 地址，",["$","code","code-4",{"className":"$undefined","children":"static"}]," 表示我们要为接口分配一个静态 IP 地址（而不是通过 DHCP 获得）。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"address 192.168.50.131"}],": 这一行设置了网络接口的静态 IP 地址。在这个例子中，我们为 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ens33"}]," 接口分配了 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"192.168.50.131"}]," IP 地址。"]}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"IP 地址是 Internet 协议（IP）用于在网络中唯一标识设备的数字标签。每个连接到网络的设备都需要一个唯一的 IP 地址，以便其他设备可以找到并与之通信。IP 地址通常分为两种版本：IPv4 和 IPv6。在此示例中，我们使用了一个 IPv4 地址。"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"netmask 255.255.255.0"}],": 这一行定义了子网掩码。在这个例子中，子网掩码是 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"255.255.255.0"}],"，表示前三个字节（24 位）是网络地址，最后一个字节（8 位）是主机地址。"]}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"子网掩码用于划分 IP 地址的网络部分和主机部分。子网掩码与 IP 地址进行按位与操作，从而得到网络地址。这有助于确定哪些 IP 地址属于同一子网，以便正确地将数据包路由到目的地。子网划分有助于组织网络、提高安全性和管理性。"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"gateway 192.168.50.2"}],": 这一行设置了默认网关。在这个例子中，我们将默认网关设置为 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"192.168.50.2"}],"。默认网关是用于将数据包发送到其他网络的路由器或设备的 IP 地址。"]}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"网关是一个充当网络中数据包传输的中继点的设备，通常是一个路由器。当一个设备需要将数据包发送到不同子网的另一个设备时，它会将数据包发送到网关。网关负责将数据包路由到正确的目的地。默认网关是设备用于将数据包发送到其他网络的首选网关。"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"dns-nameservers 8.8.8.8 8.8.4.4"}],": 这一行指定了 DNS 服务器的 IP 地址。在这个例子中，我们使用了谷歌的公共 DNS 服务器 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"8.8.8.8"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"8.8.4.4"}],"。DNS 服务器用于将主机名解析为 IP 地址。"]}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["域名系统（DNS）是将人类可读的域名（例如 ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"http://www.baidu.com%EF%BC%89IP","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"http://www.baidu.com%EF%BC%89IP"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"www.baidu.com）IP","position":{"start":{"line":200,"column":28,"offset":5814},"end":{"line":200,"column":44,"offset":5830}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":200,"column":28,"offset":5814},"end":{"line":200,"column":44,"offset":5830}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"www.baidu.com）IP"}]," 地址的系统。DNS 服务器是负责执行此解析过程的服务器。当您在浏览器中输入一个网址时，计算机会向 DNS 服务器查询该域名对应的 IP 地址，然后将请求发送到该 IP 地址以获取网页内容。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"配置文件中的这些设置将在系统启动时生效。要立即应用更改，您可以使用以下命令重启网络服务："}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"BASH","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-bash","children":[["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-built_in","children":"sudo"}]," systemctl restart networking\n"]}]}],"\n"]}]
