20:["$","pre","pre-10",{"data-language":"SH","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-sh","children":[["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"# The number of milliseconds of each tick"}],"\ntickTime=2000\n",["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"# The number of ticks that the initial"}],"\n",["$","span","span-2",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"# synchronization phase can take"}],"\ninitLimit=10\n",["$","span","span-3",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"# The number of ticks that can pass between"}],"\n",["$","span","span-4",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"# sending a request and getting an acknowledgement"}],"\nsyncLimit=5\n",["$","span","span-5",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"# the directory where the snapshot is stored."}],"\n",["$","span","span-6",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"# 设置数据存储目录"}],"\ndataDir=/opt/zookeeper-3.5.9/data\n",["$","span","span-7",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"# the port at which the clients will connect"}],"\nclientPort=2181\n",["$","span","span-8",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"# 设置集群信息"}],"\nserver.1=kafka1.com:2888:3888\nserver.2=kafka2.com:2888:3888\nserver.3=kafka3.com:2888:3888\n"]}]}]
21:["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["在 Zookeeper 的配置文件中，",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"server.x=hostname:port1:port2"}]," 这种格式的配置项是用来设置 Zookeeper 集群（集群模式下）的。其中，",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"x"}]," 是服务器的 ID，",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"hostname"}]," 是服务器的主机名或 IP 地址，",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"port1"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-4",{"className":"$undefined","children":"port2"}]," 是用于集群间通信的端口。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"具体来说："}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"port1（2888）"}],"：这是服务器之间用于相互通信的端口。Zookeeper 服务器使用这个端口进行 leader 选举以及同步 follower 和 leader 之间的状态。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"port2（3888）"}],"：这个端口用于服务器之间的 leader 选举。在 Zookeeper 集群启动或者在 leader 服务器崩溃后，follower 服务器会通过这个端口进行新一轮的 leader 选举。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"这两个端口可以根据你的网络配置进行修改，但必须在所有的 Zookeeper 服务器上保持一致。"}],"\n"]}]
